+# v1.10.14 — SQM/tc speed limiter
+
+- Removed device speed limiting through `nft limit rate over ... drop`.
+- Added real tc-based shaping: HTB + fq_codel classes for static DHCP devices.
+- Download is shaped on LAN egress by destination IPv4.
+- Upload is shaped through IFB when the kernel module/action is available; fallback is tc police.
+- Old `podkop_tg_speed*` nft tables are deleted automatically during start/update.
+- Watchdog now restores tc qdisc/classes if interface/firewall reload removes them.
+- Visible version: `Podkop Telegram Agent v1.10.14`.
+
 # v1.10.13 — Speed limit watchdog fix
 
 - Fixed device speed limits that could stop working after about a minute because of OpenWrt flow offload/firewall reloads.
